+// The space icon picker's Icon tab (M6 轮2): Arc's 56 monochrome glyphs in
+// Arc's own order, 8 per row (decisions.md 「M6 轮2」§3 g19 f_01666). The
+// |name| is what a space stores after the "vi:" prefix (workspace_space.h),
+// so it is a stable identifier, never a Chromium icon name -- the views
+// layer maps it to a gfx::VectorIcon (views/tabs/common/
